    "bbox": [
      115.2,
      395.59,
      295.3,
      417.68
    ],
    "text": "Land Ministry Ref. : 4-3/15/2015/VE)157Divi. Secretary's Ref. : HIK/DS/LND/04/02/50",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      431.6,
      295.45,
      489.68
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land acquisition(amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land/servitude* which is required fora public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      503.59,
      266.57,
      513.67
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/ servitude to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      527.6,
      295.35,
      597.68
    ],
    "text": "A block of land in total extent of 0.4443 Hectare depicted inbasic plan No. 4290 of 16.11.2017 prepared by Surveyor General,situated in the Grama Niladhari Division, No. 45 Maha Hegoda,in the village of Maliduwa in Divisional Secretary's Divisionof Hikkaduwa, District of Galle, Southern Province. Theboundaries of the aforesaid block of land are as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      611.6,
      295.4,
      657.68
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1Name of the Land: Hadanagodawatta; Claimant: State;Original Claimant: Land Reforms Commission; Extent: 0.4443Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      348.08,
      547.27,
      383.12
    ],
    "text": "North : Lot No. 03 depicted in B.P.G. 2500; East: Lot No. 03depicted in B.P.G. 2500; South: Lot No. 03 depicted in B.P.G.2500; West: Lot No. 03 depicted in B.P.G. 2500;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      403.52,
      547.36,
      526.16
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* on whichservitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Hikkaduwa Divisional Secretariat on the 09 .04. 2018 at11 .00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing(in duplicate) on or before the 02.04.2018, the nature of theirinterests in the land the particulars of their claims forcompensation and the details of the said land/servitude*,the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      450.96,
      546.08,
      533.41,
      568.16
    ],
    "text": "W. S. SATHYANANDA,Divisional Secretary,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
